  "description": "A world where age is just a number.\nCollege student Soong has a secret: she’s 121 years old. With the invention of a wonder drug, anyone can look 21 again. And in a world without visible aging, why act your age? Anything is possible — even a romance with a man 100 years your junior.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
